# Butler Routes - Thunder Bluff recipes companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes and patterns sold by vendors spawning inside Thunder Bluff (zone 1456), verified against the local Forever game data. 28 recipes across 31 vendor links
# (see docs/horde-city-recipes-inventory.md), including the Winter Veil seasonal pair.
# Each step is gated to its profession; the one pattern that names no profession anywhere in the data
# ships ungated with an honest note. No stock-class flag exists in the data,
# so nothing is marked limited.
guide butler-routes-completionist/thunder-bluff-recipes
title Thunder Bluff - Recipes & Patterns
levels 3-60
zone Thunder Bluff
faction Horde
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords thunder-bluff, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

